# airbotix-app env (V0)

# API endpoint (platform-backend)
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.airbotix.ai

# WebSocket endpoint (same origin in prod)
VITE_WS_URL=wss://api.airbotix.ai/ws

# Google Analytics 4 measurement id for the PARENT PORTAL data stream.
# Each Airbotix frontend has its own stream (its own G-… id) inside the one
# shared GA4 property. This app hosts the kid Learn surface too: /learn, /try
# and /play NEVER load gtag.js and never send a hit, whatever this is set to
# (privacy-policy.md §8/§10 — enforced by isPortalSurface() in lib/analytics.ts).
# Portal analytics is additionally opt-in per parent. Leave unset to disable
# entirely: there is no fallback id, and dev builds never report regardless.
# VITE_GA4_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# Sentry (optional)
# VITE_SENTRY_DSN=

# Music Stage sample base — REQUIRED in production for sampled timbres
# (music-stage-prd OQ-3 launch gate). Must be our own origin (S3+CloudFront),
# hosting the gleitz soundfont layout at the root and the smpldsnds
# drum-machine layout under /drum-machines. If unset, production builds
# disable the whole smplr path and play the Tone.js fallback voices (AC-11);
# only DEV builds fall back to the external default sources.
# Production uses the SPA's own bucket + CloudFront (same origin, no CORS); the
# samples are published there by the `Publish soundfonts` workflow.
# VITE_SOUNDFONT_BASE_URL=https://app.airbotix.ai/soundfonts
